        <mxCell id="z2a" value="Applied transformations&#10;&#10;· deduplicate year-boundary rows&#10;· reconcile 197 → 210 schema&#10;· difference cumulative energy&#10;· normalise power sign&#10;· drop wind speed (52% missing)&#10;· impute or flag remaining gaps —&#10;  tilted radiation ~35%, PF/THD 41%" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1F2A5A;fontColor=#1F2A5A;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
